{"1980140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Door Project", "steam_appid": 1980140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The World</h2><br>As you receive a letter from an old friend begging for help, you jump onto the first train headed towards his town only to find out that he has disappeared, and he’s not the only one.<br><br>Immerse yourself in this community, its clans and their secrets, the projects they protects.<br><br>Use all the tools you can find and flex your creativity, track your friend down and prevent disaster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/8ebd07c9cc5edcb41eefc59bf2468ed8.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>User-interface free, this immersive simulation encourages the player to explore, analyze and interact with the world to progress through the adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/f7cdfe40ece34b0e9df1649f5ebfa5c5.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span><br><br></li><li>Explore this town freely, each neighborhood holds its own secrets.<br></li><li>Each hand can be independently controlled to pick up, inspect, move, use, destroy, throw or craft.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/ea094766d1924606c47b4643d87f18b5.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span><br><br></li><li>You can interact with almost everything you see. Some objects are useful some are not.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/a11556a8e6eb2b73c87c99b226d2dcf1.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span><br><br></li><li>Carefully consider what to hold on to. With just two hands and a small backpack, what you choose to leave behind is a matter of life and death.<br></li><li>Interact with &quot;people&quot; of the town. Show them an item and see what they have to say.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/5d0dc095045d45c8965bd6ab53249c88.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span><br><br></li><li>Each situation you face can be solved multiple ways.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/68d889642e47c73f2898533735511cfe.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span><br><br></li><li>Sleuth in daylight or lurk through the night. The challenges you face may change with the sun, but danger is always present.<br><br>                                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/cfbacc36169f85ab6b3b98aede7f104f.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The World</h2><br>As you receive a letter from an old friend begging for help, you jump onto the first train headed towards his town only to find out that he has disappeared, and he’s not the only one.<br><br>Immerse yourself in this community, its clans and their secrets, the projects they protects.<br><br>Use all the tools you can find and flex your creativity, track your friend down and prevent disaster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/8ebd07c9cc5edcb41eefc59bf2468ed8.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>User-interface free, this immersive simulation encourages the player to explore, analyze and interact with the world to progress through the adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/f7cdfe40ece34b0e9df1649f5ebfa5c5.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span><br><br></li><li>Explore this town freely, each neighborhood holds its own secrets.<br></li><li>Each hand can be independently controlled to pick up, inspect, move, use, destroy, throw or craft.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/ea094766d1924606c47b4643d87f18b5.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span><br><br></li><li>You can interact with almost everything you see. Some objects are useful some are not.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/a11556a8e6eb2b73c87c99b226d2dcf1.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span><br><br></li><li>Carefully consider what to hold on to. With just two hands and a small backpack, what you choose to leave behind is a matter of life and death.<br></li><li>Interact with &quot;people&quot; of the town. Show them an item and see what they have to say.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/5d0dc095045d45c8965bd6ab53249c88.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span><br><br></li><li>Each situation you face can be solved multiple ways.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/68d889642e47c73f2898533735511cfe.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span><br><br></li><li>Sleuth in daylight or lurk through the night. The challenges you face may change with the sun, but danger is always present.<br><br>                                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/extras/cfbacc36169f85ab6b3b98aede7f104f.avif?t=1667963402\" width=618 height=350 /></span></li></ul>", "short_description": "Set up in a beautiful little town, you will have to investigate the mysterious disappearance of your friend and his community. Based on a high interactivity with the world, be prepared to use your brain and the tools around you for this unique first person adventure!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/header.jpg?t=1667963402", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1667963402", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1667963402", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBA GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBA GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBA</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBA GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</stron